 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology Co., Ltd",
 "title": "ES5AB to ES5JB: 5 A fast recovery rectifiers, 50 V to 600 V, SMB (DO-214AA)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "Seven glass-passivated fast recovery rectifiers in the surface-mount SMB (DO-214AA) package, rated 5.0 A average forward current and 150 A surge, with repetitive peak reverse voltage from 50 V (ES5AB) to 600 V (ES5JB). Reverse recovery is at most 35 ns; maximum forward voltage at 5.0 A is 1.0 V, 1.3 V or 1.7 V depending on the voltage grade. Uses given are high-frequency rectification and freewheeling in switch-mode converters and inverters. ES5JB is the 600 V part, with a 1.7 V maximum forward voltage.",
 "key_figures": [
